	(text_box "The 10pin connector used requires an stacking pin header to correctly make contact. To handle this issue\nthe connection is broken into two disinct sections the round or machined 2.54mm header and the standard\nduPont style 2.54mm square header that fits the square servo motor pins.\n\nRoundPin Female Header: C5146770, C5159939, C6684560, C19184304\n\nSquarePin Female Header: C2897373, C2905418"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 76.2 0)
		(size 101.6 25.4)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
